Query:
-- Description: 1) Look at the different values in the `status` field of the bikeshare
--              stations table so we can later keep only the “active” ones.
SELECT DISTINCT `status`
FROM `bigquery-public-data.austin_bikeshare.bikeshare_stations`
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
status
closed
active
Query:
-- Description: 2) See a sample of stations that are currently active
--              together with their council district codes.
SELECT `station_id`,
       `name`,
       `council_district`,
       `status`
FROM `bigquery-public-data.austin_bikeshare.bikeshare_stations`
WHERE `status` = 'active'
LIMIT 20;
